   "title": "Clash Rig",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Clash Rig: over-the-top fight scenes\nPick a **fight style**, a **hero**, a **rival**, an **arena** and a **camera rig**, press **Run**: one 2-4 s shot with LTX-2.5's own impact sound.\n\n**Fight styles**: boxing, muay thai, MMA, Brazilian jiu-jitsu, kung fu / wuxia wire-work, and the **anime power fight** flagship.\n**Rigs**: ringside low angle, punch-cam, over-the-shoulder, impact crash zoom, bullet-time orbit, overhead, slow-mo replay push-in,\nsky-high wide, ground-level debris cam, face close-up, handheld shoulder cam, hero low-angle upshot, whip-pan side profile, rival POV, drone dive.\n**Arenas**: boxing ring, underground cage, dojo, rooftop at night, rain alley, volcanic wasteland, floating sky islands, desert canyon, neon city, bamboo forest, ruined stadium, or type your own.\n\n**Full fight**: leave rig on *auto (fight sequence)*, set **shot_index** to *increment*, then queue 8 runs.\nEvery run advances the fight's arc (opening exchange -> punch-cam -> power moment -> ground impact -> bullet-time orbit -> reaction -> crash zoom -> slow-mo finisher)."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
