   "title": "First frame (Codex / Nano Banana)",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Clash Plate** generates the camera-rig opening frame off-GPU via **Codex** (Nano Banana fallback) from your two fighter refs, keeping 100% of the Studio GPU free for LTX-2.5. Closed model: use the open-weights clash_rig_fight when the rules ask for open nodes only."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
