   "title": "Motion",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**LTX-2.5 22B distilled**, image to video in two stages (half-res pass, x2 latent upscale, refine), with **synchronized audio**: the impacts, grunts, crowd and wind come from the same model. Size, length and fps all come from the rig node."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
