   "title": "Impact FX",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Clash FX** adds what a real fight edit adds: hit flashes, camera jolts, chromatic punch, radial speed lines, anime impact frames and speed ramps, using each rig's own defaults. Sliders at -1 follow the rig; strength 0 bypasses it. Frame count never changes, so the LTX audio stays in sync. Both the raw and the FX clip are saved."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
